    ///
    /// There's two implementations available:
    ///
    /// - [`OwnedSortedLinkedListStorage`]: stores the data in an array `[T; N]` whose size is known at compile time.
    /// - [`ViewSortedLinkedListStorage`]: stores the data in an unsized `[T]`.
